{%- comment -%}
  Merchant-controlled product labels — the in-theme replacement for the paid
  "Product Labels & Badges" app.

  A label is a product tag that starts with "תווית:" — everything after the
  colon is rendered as an amber offer badge, e.g. the tag
  "תווית:משלוח חינם" renders a "משלוח חינם" badge. Labels are managed where
  merchandising already happens (the product's tags in the admin), work in
  bulk via the admin's bulk editor, and need no external service.

  The automatic badges (מבצע % / חדש / אזל מהמלאי) are separate and unchanged.

  Accepts:
    product {Object}  product (required)
    limit   {Number}  max labels to render (default 2 — cards get crowded fast)
    class   {String}  extra class per badge
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign labels_limit = limit | default: 2
  assign labels_shown = 0
-%}
{%- if settings.enable_tag_labels -%}
  {%- for tag in product.tags -%}
    {%- assign tag_prefix = tag | slice: 0, 6 -%}
    {%- if tag_prefix == 'תווית:' and labels_shown < labels_limit -%}
      {%- assign label_text = tag | remove_first: 'תווית:' | strip -%}
      {%- if label_text != blank -%}
        <span class="badge badge--offer {{ class }}">{{ label_text | escape }}</span>
        {%- assign labels_shown = labels_shown | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
